# CORE_ENGINE_FORMAL_MODEL.md — Core Engine Formal/Semantic Model

## 1. Purpose
This is the consolidated working document for DNA Calc core engine formalization.

It unifies:
- formal/semantic model content extracted from `ARCHITECTURE_AND_REQUIREMENTS.md`,
- deferred and exploratory formal-model notes previously captured in:
  - `notes/FORMAL_MODELS_IDEAS.md`,
