  - `notes/FORMAL_CORE_STATUS_AND_SUGGESTIONS_DRAFT.md`.

## 2. Authority and Confidence Labels
Document role boundaries:
- `CHARTER.md`: doctrine authority.
- `ARCHITECTURE_AND_REQUIREMENTS.md`: architecture constraints and requirements authority.
- `OPERATIONS.md`: process/gating authority.
- This document: detailed core formal/semantic model authority.

Confidence labels used below:
- `Stable`: intended as current formal baseline.
- `Provisional`: accepted model shape with unresolved details.
- `Exploratory`: ideas/proposals not yet normative.

